  "reasoning": "The defendants secretly stole oil from a pipeline and also stole a van used to transport the oil, which constitutes theft of property (盗窃). Their use of heating equipment led to a fire that destroyed the van, a transformer, and electrical equipment, which fits the crime of arson (放火). Both offenses are evident from the facts.",
